  helperId: magic_helper
  title: Magic Combat
  bodyText: "You have gained your first magic weapon. Wands can be used freely to
    cast any spell but if you want to increase your damage, it might be worth using
    runes and a staff. \n\nMagic spells will consume mana to cast instead of energy
    for abilities. Depending on your chance to apply ailments, using a certain elemental
    type spell can apply ailments to the enemy either burn, shock or chill.\n\nTry
    hitting 'Tab' and equipping the magic weapon on your secondary gear set. This
    makes switching between two styles easy."
